{"sections":[{"slug":"亏格","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"亏格"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">亏格</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"alias":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">拓扑亏格</span>"},"page-title":{"Plain":"“亏格”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">亏格</span> (genus) <span lang=\"zh\">有多种含义</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">它们之间联系紧密</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">拓扑亏格</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">连通可定向曲面的亏格是其</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">洞</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的数量</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">球面的亏格为</span> $0$, <span lang=\"zh\">环面的亏格为</span> $1$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">带边曲面的亏格与欧拉数的关系为</span>\n$$\r\n\\chi = 2-2g-b,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $b$ <span lang=\"zh\">为边界的连通分支数</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/复曲线","text":"Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">面</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">其拓扑亏格</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">算数亏格</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">几何亏格三者相等</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">算数亏格</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":" $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">算数亏格</span></strong> (arithmetic genus) <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>\n$$\r\np_a(X) = 1-\\chi(X,\\mathcal O_X).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">对于代数闭域上的整射影曲线</span>, $h^0(X,\\mathcal O_X)=1$, <span lang=\"zh\">故</span> $p_a(X)= h^1(X,\\mathcal O_X).$ (<span lang=\"zh\">高维的情形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">后者不是特别自然</span>.)</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">正则不可约射影复曲线对应的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Riemann面","text":"Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">面</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的亏格</span> $g=p_a$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">几何亏格</span></h2>\n<p>$k$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的正则不可约射影</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/曲线","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">曲线</span>"}},{"Plain":" $C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">几何亏格</span></strong> (geometric genus) <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $h^0(C,\\Omega_{C/k})$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">推广到高维情形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">维光滑代数簇</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">考虑</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/典范层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">典范丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\mathscr K_{X/k} := \\det \\Omega_{X/k} = \\Omega_{X/k}^n,\r\n$$<span lang=\"zh\">即</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">体积形式</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的层</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">当</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/射影簇","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">射影簇</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">时它是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Serre对偶","text":"Serre <span lang=\"zh\">对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中的</span> $\\omega_X$). $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">几何亏格</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义为</span>\n$$\r\np_g(X) := h^0(X,\\mathscr K_{X/k}).\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}